. These options are specifically crafted to embody luxury, enhance visual appeal, and can be adapted for seasonal and festive themes, aligning with the persona\'s desire for \'Luxury Looks in Packaging\'.\n• afterOutcome: His baked goods are beautifully showcased in premium packaging, attracting customers seeking high-quality, visually appealing products. Sales increase, brand perception elevates, and he feels immense pride in his product\'s complete presentation, achieving the aspirational \'Luxury Looks\' he desired.\n• afterEmotion: Proud, confident, successful, delighted, and empowered, seeing his business thrive and his products receive the attention and value they deserve.\n• afterText: Luxurious. Eye-catching. Stands out. Elevate your brand with packaging that speaks volumes. Showcase luxury, attract more customers, and celebrate every season with style.\n• mood: Aspirational, empowering, transformative, sophisticated, and celebratory.\n• theme: From overlooked to undeniable: the power of premium presentation; elevating everyday products into luxury experiences; achieving brand prestige through superior visual appeal.\n• tone: Encouraging, sophisticated, results-oriented, professional, inspiring, and persuasive.\n• colorPreference: Rich, jewel tones (e.g., emerald green, sapphire blue, ruby red) combined with metallic accents (gold, rose gold, silver) and elegant neutrals (creams, charcoal greys, deep browns) to signify luxury and sophistication.\n• finishType: Matte finish with selective spot UV varnish for logos or key details, metallic foil stamping, embossed textures, smooth, high-quality cardstock, and options for sustainable premium materials.',1,'2026-03-09 05:48:34',0,NULL),(10,60,'visuals | comparative | Product A vs Product B','==============================\n      VISUAL INFORMATION\n      ==============================\n\n      Mode: visuals\n      Media Type: comparative\n      Media Sub Type: Product A vs Product B\n\n\n      -------------------