:48:34','2026-03-09 05:51:21','default'),(1392,61,'beforePersona','A bakery owner in Canada, aged 18-24, seeking luxury aesthetics for their products but currently using basic, uninspiring packaging that compromises their desired high-end image and customer experience.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1393,61,'beforeProblem','Current packaging options (like cardboard) are flimsy, lack durability, provide inadequate protection, and fail to convey the desired luxury and premium feel, leading to damaged products and a diminished brand perception.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1394,61,'beforeEmotion','Frustration with packaging failures, disappointment in the lack of sophistication, and concern over product integrity and brand reputation.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1395,61,'beforeEnvironment','A basic bakery counter or a generic shipping area, with a stack of generic, slightly worn, or visibly flimsy cardboard boxes that look cheap and unprofessional, possibly showing minor dents or creases.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1396,61,'beforeText','DON\'T LET YOUR PACKAGING FALL FLAT!  \n\n- Flimsy & easily damaged  \n- Lacks premium appeal  \n- Offers poor protection  \n\nIs your packaging truly reflecting your product\'s value?',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1397,61,'afterSupport','Our premium MDF product boxes offer strong MDF construction for ultimate durability, a smooth, high-end finish for a luxurious look, and customizable sizes for a perfect fit, ensuring superior protection over conventional packaging.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1398,61,'afterOutcome','Customers receive perfectly preserved, elegantly presented products, enhancing brand loyalty and elevating the perception of quality. Your brand gains a sophisticated edge with durable, reusable, and visually stunning packaging.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1399,61,'afterEmotion','Confidence and pride in a superior product presentation, satisfaction from secure and elegant packaging, and delight from positive customer reactions.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1400,61,'afterText','ELEVATE YOUR BRAND WITH MDF PRODUCT BOXES!  \n\n- Durable & reusable  \n- Premium look & feel  \n- Superior product protection  \n\nUnbox luxury, every time.',1,'mandatory','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1401,61,'mood','Contrasting, aspirational, sophisticated, solution-focused.',1,'optional','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1402,61,'theme','Transformation from vulnerability and inadequacy to strength, luxury, and security in packaging.',1,'optional','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1403,61,'tone','Authoritative, reassuring, and persuasive, highlighting the clear advantages and premium nature of MDF boxes.',1,'optional','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1404,61,'colorPreference','For the \'before\' (left) side: muted, dull browns, greys, or off-whites, suggesting common cardboard. For the \'after\' (right) side: rich, warm browns, deep charcoals, with elegant metallic accents (gold, silver) or pristine whites, emphasizing luxury and quality.',1,'optional','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1405,61,'finishType','Photorealistic rendering or high-quality product photography. The \'before\' side should subtly emphasize imperfections like creases, slight bends, or a matte, unsophisticated texture. The \'after\' side should display a flawless, smooth, sleek, and polished finish with clear definition and rich texture.',1,'optional','2026-03-09 08:35:07','2026-03-09 08:35:07','default'),(1406,62,'beforePersona','',1,'mandatory','2026-03-11 09:44:00','2026-03-11 09:44:00','def